1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:03,709 --> 00:01:07,463
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Back when I was in elementary school, I
wasn't necessarily disliked by anyone.</font>

3
00:01:07,546 --> 00:01:11,300
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I never made any close friends, or
was part of any social circles either.</font>

4
00:01:13,427 --> 00:01:15,346
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can I join, you guys?</font>

5
00:01:15,429 --> 00:01:19,850
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Didn't see you there, Sawako.
- Yeah sure, you can play with us.</font>

6
00:01:19,934 --> 00:01:24,480
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shino, a classmate of
mine, called out to me one day.</font>

7
00:01:24,563 --> 00:01:27,483
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey, Sadako!
- Her misspeaking my name was the start.</font>

8
00:01:27,566 --> 00:01:30,444
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako?</font>

9
00:01:30,528 --> 00:01:32,113
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sadako, huh?
- It's Sadako!</font>

10
00:01:33,197 --> 00:01:36,784
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've been known as "Sadako" since. In
middle school, some of my classmates</font>

11
00:01:36,867 --> 00:01:39,620
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">started a joke about me...</font>

12
00:01:39,703 --> 00:01:42,456
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sadako looks like she has a sixth sense!
- I wouldn't be surprised if that was true.</font>

13
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:45,793
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It is true, it's gotta be!</font>

14
00:01:45,876 --> 00:01:49,463
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Before I knew it, I was tied to the
occult. Things weren't much different once</font>

15
00:01:49,547 --> 00:01:52,383
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I entered high school...</font>

16
00:01:52,466 --> 00:01:55,302
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I hear Sadako can talk to the dead.
- Also, if your eyes meet for over</font>

17
00:01:55,386 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">three-seconds, then in seven days...</font>

18
00:01:59,223 --> 00:02:03,018
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And from there, the rumors all
began to snowball... supposedly.</font>

19
00:02:04,728 --> 00:02:09,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That being said, when I look back at
everything, I actually think I was pretty</font>

20
00:02:09,108 --> 00:02:13,404
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">fortunate up to this point. While I did
get upset at times, I can't recall ever</font>

21
00:02:13,487 --> 00:02:17,199
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">feeling like I was truly miserable.</font>

22
00:02:17,283 --> 00:02:21,036
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've been meaning to mention...
You remember that Sadako rumor?</font>

23
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,581
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The one about Yano and
Yoshida being her backup?</font>

24
00:02:23,664 --> 00:02:26,125
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's a misunderstanding!</font>

25
00:02:26,667 --> 00:02:32,006
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Those two girls aren't my backup. Nor
have they ever been anything like that.</font>

26
00:02:34,508 --> 00:02:37,511
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shut the hell up. We get it.</font>

27
00:02:38,512 --> 00:02:43,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... it's totally true that
they're a slut and a delinquent, right?</font>

28
00:02:50,774 --> 00:02:52,026
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning, Kazehaya.</font>

29
00:02:52,109 --> 00:02:53,235
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning.</font>

30
00:02:53,319 --> 00:02:56,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Morning, Ryu.
- Same to you. Huh?</font>

31
00:02:56,488 --> 00:02:59,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh...</font>

32
00:02:59,825 --> 00:03:02,244
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- That's a huge crowd.
- What happened?</font>

33
00:03:02,328 --> 00:03:04,747
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, hey there, Kazehaya.
- There's an argument</font>

34
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:08,167
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- in the girls bathroom.
- There is?</font>

35
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:10,586
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're never gonna guess
who's involved in it though!</font>

36
00:03:10,669 --> 00:03:12,963
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's Sadako and some girls from Class A!</font>

37
00:03:13,047 --> 00:03:15,341
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kuronuma?! But why?
- We were in there with</font>

38
00:03:15,424 --> 00:03:18,260
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">them and heard everything...</font>

39
00:03:18,344 --> 00:03:21,222
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Those rumors spreading about Yano and
Yoshida... I guess Sadako was the one who</font>

40
00:03:21,305 --> 00:03:24,558
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- started them.
- What rumors?</font>

41
00:03:24,642 --> 00:03:29,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The ones about assaulting the old
man and Yano being easy, right?</font>

42
00:03:29,355 --> 00:03:31,941
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, I heard it was Sadako, too.</font>

43
00:03:32,024 --> 00:03:33,067
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No way...</font>

44
00:03:34,109 --> 00:03:37,488
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I will try my hardest and
will become their friend!</font>

45
00:03:37,571 --> 00:03:40,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're wrong! I know~
she would never do that!</font>

46
00:03:41,575 --> 00:03:43,827
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can you guys keep it
down? You're being too loud.</font>

47
00:03:43,911 --> 00:03:46,205
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What's going on here?</font>

48
00:03:46,288 --> 00:03:51,001
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma is giving her all... -...to stop the
rumors about the two of you... to defend you</font>

49
00:03:51,085 --> 00:03:57,383
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- both from the rumors. -Move!
- Outta the way!</font>

50
00:03:59,385 --> 00:04:04,056
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You're holding back, aren't you?
- Course I am!</font>

51
00:04:04,139 --> 00:04:07,810
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I can't interfere. I
have to stay out of it.</font>

52
00:04:07,893 --> 00:04:11,397
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This is something they have to handle.</font>

53
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:16,068
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just hang in there
Kuronuma. You've got this.</font>

54
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't give up.</font>

55
00:04:20,572 --> 00:04:23,826
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Those words you said...
please take them back.</font>

56
00:04:23,909 --> 00:04:27,371
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? What the hell's
this? Don't touch me.</font>

57
00:04:27,454 --> 00:04:30,916
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're mistaken. Nothing you
said about them is true at all.</font>

58
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:34,837
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are you guys hearing this right now?</font>

59
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:39,341
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm telling you, Yano and
Yoshida aren't what you say they are!</font>

60
00:04:40,009 --> 00:04:46,181
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If they heard you say those things, I know
that it would really hurt their feelings.</font>

61
00:04:46,265 --> 00:04:49,977
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, don't stand here and act innocent!</font>

62
00:04:51,603 --> 00:04:55,357
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're one to talk about hurting nice
people's feelings, aren't you? -Every</font>

63
00:04:55,441 --> 00:04:59,194
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">single word about those two being a slut
and a delinquent, came directly from your</font>

64
00:04:59,278 --> 00:05:03,198
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">mouth. -From "me"?</font>

65
00:05:03,282 --> 00:05:04,116
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... W-Who?</font>

66
00:05:05,951 --> 00:05:09,705
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are you serious... I said all the rumors
circulating about Yano and Yoshida came</font>

67
00:05:09,788 --> 00:05:13,584
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- from you!
- W-Wait... me?!</font>

68
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:20,466
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey! Sadako got pushed!
- Maybe we should go break this up.</font>

69
00:05:21,884 --> 00:05:22,926
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Leave it to us.
- Leave it to us.</font>

70
00:05:24,887 --> 00:05:29,183
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}I-I don't understand! Why would I ever say
anything bad about them? -I could never!</font>

71
00:05:29,266 --> 00:05:33,562
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because those two have always treated
me with nothing but absolute kindness, I</font>

72
00:05:33,645 --> 00:05:37,941
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">wouldn't-- -Shut up
already. I don't care about that.</font>

73
00:05:38,901 --> 00:05:42,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We're just here to settle this with you
once and for all. Besides, if you want my</font>

74
00:05:42,237 --> 00:05:45,491
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">opinion...</font>

75
00:05:45,574 --> 00:05:50,412
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm willing to bet they were only hanging
out with you for some kicks and giggles.</font>

76
00:05:50,496 --> 00:05:55,376
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But they've probably gotten bored of
you. Clearly, you feel the same way.</font>

77
00:05:56,543 --> 00:06:01,673
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Your reason for getting close to them was
to be around Kazehaya, wasn't it? At this</font>

78
00:06:01,757 --> 00:06:06,887
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">point, they're nothing but obstacles
for you, huh? You really piss me off.</font>

79
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:11,016
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You should stay away from everyone and
keep to yourself. -If you do that, then</font>

80
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:15,187
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">maybe we'll actually think about
leaving you alo-- -You're wrong!</font>

81
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:16,146
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

82
00:06:22,694 --> 00:06:25,197
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You don't have to leave me alone.</font>

83
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,616
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just... take back what you said.</font>

84
00:06:27,699 --> 00:06:29,118
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What are you talking...</font>

85
00:06:29,201 --> 00:06:32,788
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All of it... Everything
you're saying is wrong!</font>

86
00:06:32,871 --> 00:06:35,374
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You don't get it. And how could you?</font>

87
00:06:36,166 --> 00:06:40,212
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess it's 'cause... you
don't know anything about them.</font>

88
00:06:41,964 --> 00:06:46,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">-"It's because of how awesome you are"
- That win's completely yours.</font>

89
00:06:46,135 --> 00:06:50,222
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">While everyone else simply ignored me...</font>

90
00:06:50,848 --> 00:06:52,724
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here's a treat. So enjoy.</font>

91
00:06:54,143 --> 00:06:57,729
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They never feared me or
pretended I didn't exist.</font>

92
00:06:58,272 --> 00:07:00,232
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Dude, you're
drenched! Here's my track suit</font>

93
00:07:00,315 --> 00:07:02,401
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ew!</font>

94
00:07:02,484 --> 00:07:07,739
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They've always treated me kindly,
even though they never had a reason to.</font>

95
00:07:08,282 --> 00:07:11,577
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But you wouldn't know
any of that, would you?</font>

96
00:07:12,828 --> 00:07:16,081
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You all have no idea how much I like both
Yano and Yoshida. More than I can put into</font>

97
00:07:16,165 --> 00:07:19,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">words.</font>

98
00:07:20,836 --> 00:07:21,753
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Much more!</font>

99
00:07:23,255 --> 00:07:24,882
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako, do you like us?</font>

100
00:07:26,049 --> 00:07:28,427
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... I wouldn't exactly say "like"...</font>

101
00:07:29,553 --> 00:07:32,848
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Instead of "like", I'd
say it's more, that--</font>

102
00:07:42,441 --> 00:07:44,401
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I love them. That's why...</font>

103
00:08:03,086 --> 00:08:06,757
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y-Yoshida! She spread those rumors
about you and you're still gonna help her?</font>

104
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:10,511
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It wasn't Sadako.</font>

105
00:08:11,303 --> 00:08:13,764
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- She'd never do something like that.
- She'd never do something like that.</font>

106
00:08:15,015 --> 00:08:17,017
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What the hell are you--
- If we say it wasn't her,</font>

107
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,102
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">then it wasn't and that's that.</font>

108
00:08:19,186 --> 00:08:22,231
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Now get outta here
before I hafta force you out.</font>

109
00:08:22,314 --> 00:08:25,400
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">W- What gives?! Why don't you mind your
own business? I was talking to Sadako, not</font>

110
00:08:25,484 --> 00:08:28,195
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to you guys!</font>

111
00:08:28,278 --> 00:08:31,031
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmm? You've got some guts tryin' to order
me around like this. We went to the same</font>

112
00:08:31,114 --> 00:08:34,826
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">middle school so there's no
way you don't know, right?</font>

113
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:37,913
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">About me winning 99 times in a row
against the guys I fought back then?</font>

114
00:08:37,996 --> 00:08:41,458
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously, Chizu?</font>

115
00:08:41,542 --> 00:08:46,296
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You lay a finger on Sadako again
and I'll make sure you regret it.</font>

116
00:08:47,381 --> 00:08:52,761
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Fine! You can have that freak. Let's go!
- Please, wait! I want to make sure you</font>

117
00:08:52,844 --> 00:08:56,223
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">know that all the rumors you've heard are
false!</font>

118
00:08:56,306 --> 00:08:59,810
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh, you annoying
little... Yeah, okay, I get it!</font>

119
00:08:59,893 --> 00:09:04,147
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll take back what I
said. Are you satisfied?</font>

120
00:09:05,774 --> 00:09:09,152
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She actually... understood?</font>

121
00:09:11,989 --> 00:09:15,200
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, guys! Can you believe it?</font>

122
00:09:16,201 --> 00:09:20,455
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was able to get through to her!</font>

123
00:09:20,539 --> 00:09:25,836
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}There's no more misunderstanding!
Now they know... The rumors are false!</font>

124
00:09:26,461 --> 00:09:28,213
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako, It's all right.</font>

125
00:09:29,423 --> 00:09:31,466
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't worry about it, okay?</font>

126
00:09:35,387 --> 00:09:36,597
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It wasn't Sadako.</font>

127
00:09:37,139 --> 00:09:39,600
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- She'd never do something like that.
- She'd never do something like that.</font>

128
00:09:41,643 --> 00:09:42,686
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yano... Yoshida...</font>

129
00:09:45,731 --> 00:09:48,317
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you both...</font>

130
00:09:51,236 --> 00:09:54,031
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...For believing in me. Thank you.</font>

131
00:09:57,743 --> 00:10:01,580
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, Kazehaya? Did we do
something... to make you mad?</font>

132
00:10:01,663 --> 00:10:03,915
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I am not mad!
- P-Please have mercy on us!</font>

133
00:10:03,999 --> 00:10:06,251
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Look, it's just...</font>

134
00:10:10,005 --> 00:10:15,469
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If there's one thing I
despise, it's gossip.</font>

135
00:10:17,387 --> 00:10:22,100
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">With that being said, everything about
Yano and Yoshida is a lie. You should know</font>

136
00:10:22,184 --> 00:10:26,855
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">better. Besides, you really think
Kuronuma would say those things?</font>

137
00:10:26,938 --> 00:10:28,523
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well- I y'know...</font>

138
00:10:28,607 --> 00:10:31,276
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest, I don't
actually know that much about her.</font>

139
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:34,029
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess since they were rumors, I
thought it was possible she could have</font>

140
00:10:34,112 --> 00:10:36,657
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">said it... So, yeah.</font>

141
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:39,326
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- No way. She fought hard to defend them.
- What do you mean?</font>

142
00:10:39,409 --> 00:10:42,996
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako was so brave. She kept trying to
protect their honor, even after she got</font>

143
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:45,332
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">pushed down.</font>

144
00:10:45,415 --> 00:10:47,709
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All we did was just stand and watch.</font>

145
00:10:48,418 --> 00:10:51,505
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Eventually, Yano and Yoshida rushed
in to save Sadako from those bullies.</font>

146
00:10:51,588 --> 00:10:54,675
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoa! She supposedly started all
this, but they still came to help her?</font>

147
00:10:54,758 --> 00:10:57,844
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah.</font>

148
00:10:57,928 --> 00:11:00,931
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then if that's the case, it means Sadako
wasn't really the one who was spreading</font>

149
00:11:01,014 --> 00:11:04,059
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- the rumors after all.
- So that was rumor too!</font>

150
00:11:04,142 --> 00:11:07,187
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought it sounded kind of sketchy.</font>

151
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:10,315
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako's great. She
let me borrow her notes.</font>

152
00:11:10,399 --> 00:11:12,943
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was thanks to her that I was
able to ace my exams yesterday.</font>

153
00:11:13,026 --> 00:11:15,570
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Dude, same here!
- Sadako's pretty awesome, isn't she?</font>

154
00:11:15,654 --> 00:11:18,824
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I knew it was just gossip. I
mean, it was totally obvious.</font>

155
00:11:18,907 --> 00:11:21,660
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She'd be happy to
hear so many compliments.</font>

156
00:11:21,743 --> 00:11:24,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And it's all thanks to Hirano and Endo</font>

157
00:11:25,038 --> 00:11:30,794
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nice job, you guys!
You did Sadako a solid!</font>

158
00:11:30,877 --> 00:11:33,046
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You can do this, Kuronuma.</font>

159
00:11:34,047 --> 00:11:38,927
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess I figured if I could clear
up a misunderstanding, I should.</font>

160
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:39,928
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako...</font>

161
00:11:40,804 --> 00:11:45,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For the longest time, I kept telling
myself that some things just can't be</font>

162
00:11:45,517 --> 00:11:50,355
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">helped. "If I failed again,
that's just how it goes."</font>

163
00:11:50,439 --> 00:11:53,942
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">While I always wanted to be closer with
everyone... Deep down, I... I must've given up</font>

164
00:11:54,025 --> 00:11:57,529
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">already.</font>

165
00:11:58,530 --> 00:12:02,951
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But when it came to you, I
really didn't want that. Even if...</font>

166
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:10,041
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even if I believe that being around you
could cause more rumors to spread, and</font>

167
00:12:10,125 --> 00:12:14,546
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even worse... that I may upset or hurt you
both again... I can't do it... I can't bring</font>

168
00:12:14,629 --> 00:12:19,092
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">myself to give up on the two of you.</font>

169
00:12:19,176 --> 00:12:23,305
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please know, that if I do end up doing
something that hurts you again, when it</font>

170
00:12:23,388 --> 00:12:27,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">comes to comforting someone ~ I don't
really know how. Regardless, I'd still...</font>

171
00:12:27,601 --> 00:12:31,688
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">like to stick around</font>

172
00:12:32,731 --> 00:12:36,443
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It'd be nice to stay with you guys exactly
like this. No... Actually, I want to become</font>

173
00:12:36,526 --> 00:12:40,238
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even closer.</font>

174
00:12:42,032 --> 00:12:46,036
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If there's a new problem... and it needs to
be straightened out, I'll do my best to</font>

175
00:12:46,119 --> 00:12:50,123
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">resolve it until everything's better.</font>

176
00:12:50,207 --> 00:12:53,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I know I sound unreasonable and selfish.</font>

177
00:12:53,543 --> 00:12:57,380
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yet both of them have stood there the
entire time, and haven't looked away from</font>

178
00:12:57,464 --> 00:13:01,343
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">me even once. I can tell
they're really listening.</font>

179
00:13:02,427 --> 00:13:06,681
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So I... would like to ask if
maybe you two would be my...</font>

180
00:13:09,184 --> 00:13:12,187
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I would like it if we
could become friends!</font>

181
00:13:17,776 --> 00:13:23,782
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako, you thought... that Chizu and I
were upset because of those things... And</font>

182
00:13:23,865 --> 00:13:30,205
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you assumed that by being around you
were doing nothing but causing us trouble.</font>

183
00:13:30,288 --> 00:13:36,670
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You still wanted to be friends
with us but felt that you couldn't.</font>

184
00:13:36,753 --> 00:13:40,090
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You poor thing... This is what you've
been dealing with all by yourself?</font>

185
00:13:40,173 --> 00:13:43,510
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">H-Hey, um... Be careful cause my
clothes are dirty from being on the floor...</font>

186
00:13:43,593 --> 00:13:46,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Dummy!</font>

187
00:13:51,393 --> 00:13:52,519
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're so silly.</font>

188
00:13:55,397 --> 00:13:57,899
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Jeez... I can't believe you already
answered every single question we were</font>

189
00:13:57,983 --> 00:14:00,485
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">gonna a--</font>

190
00:14:02,654 --> 00:14:07,075
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I feel guilty for doubting you for even a
second, Sadako. I'm sorry! Really! Just</font>

191
00:14:07,158 --> 00:14:11,621
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">don't ever get used to being alone again.</font>

192
00:14:12,581 --> 00:14:16,585
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Didn't you know? It's hard for us to do
anything but think the world of you. And</font>

193
00:14:16,668 --> 00:14:20,672
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">besides...</font>

194
00:14:20,755 --> 00:14:26,386
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're worried about friends... but you
don't realize, you already have them.</font>

195
00:14:26,469 --> 00:14:29,973
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako... You, me, and Yano... We are friends!</font>

196
00:14:30,765 --> 00:14:32,017
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, we are?</font>

197
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:36,104
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We already... are friends?</font>

198
00:14:38,189 --> 00:14:42,402
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't hold back anymore! C'mere
and let me love on the two of you!</font>

199
00:14:42,485 --> 00:14:46,740
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">H-hey! You're gonna give everyone the
wrong idea! Are you trying to spread</font>

200
00:14:46,823 --> 00:14:49,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">another rumor?!</font>

201
00:14:49,659 --> 00:14:52,662
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Jeez... you're a big
baby, you know that, Chizu?</font>

202
00:14:52,746 --> 00:14:56,166
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Friends, huh...
- Don't pretend you're not tearing up too!</font>

203
00:14:56,249 --> 00:14:57,167
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... I wanted...</font>

204
00:14:59,085 --> 00:15:00,003
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

205
00:15:01,379 --> 00:15:04,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...To tell you that I
learned to tell a ghost story.</font>

206
00:15:10,972 --> 00:15:13,850
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wow... My very first real friends.</font>

207
00:15:19,481 --> 00:15:22,692
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Are they crying and laughing right now?
- Maybe it's some weird best friend thing.</font>

208
00:15:22,776 --> 00:15:26,029
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Should we call someone?
- Beats me...</font>

209
00:15:29,908 --> 00:15:31,201
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They've reconciled!</font>

210
00:15:31,284 --> 00:15:35,664
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">With the main cast reunited,
harmony's been restored once more</font>

211
00:15:35,747 --> 00:15:40,126
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, y'hear that? Well, no need
for me to console Chizu, then.</font>

212
00:15:44,339 --> 00:15:48,468
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Is there's a fight happening?! Where's it
going down? Who's fighting against who?</font>

213
00:15:48,551 --> 00:15:52,722
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Outta the way, nerds!</font>

214
00:15:56,935 --> 00:15:59,688
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What the?? What do you want? We're
kinda in the middle of something and</font>

215
00:15:59,771 --> 00:16:02,524
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you're ruining it.</font>

216
00:16:02,607 --> 00:16:05,276
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You three?! I was hoping for a
brawl, not a sappy little chick flick~</font>

217
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:08,113
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">~...Alright~ somebody better
start throwing punches at someone!</font>

218
00:16:08,196 --> 00:16:11,074
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You lunatic! You call
yourself a teacher?!</font>

219
00:16:11,157 --> 00:16:13,994
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aw crap! Move it! The Show's over!</font>

220
00:16:14,077 --> 00:16:19,082
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I said scram, ya little rodents!
Make like a tree and get out of here!</font>

221
00:16:21,793 --> 00:16:25,797
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just like him to ruin the moment.</font>

222
00:16:30,051 --> 00:16:30,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's Kazehaya...</font>

223
00:16:33,555 --> 00:16:35,432
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Congrats on pulling it off.</font>

224
00:16:35,515 --> 00:16:40,311
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I heard your voice in my head
giving me words of encouragement.</font>

225
00:16:42,647 --> 00:16:47,986
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"You can do it." "Don't give up."
You cheered me on the whole time.</font>

226
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:51,114
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you... for everything.</font>

227
00:16:52,866 --> 00:16:55,660
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Did anyone else see that?
- Sadako was smiling.</font>

228
00:16:55,744 --> 00:16:58,329
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No way. Didn't know that she could.</font>

229
00:17:07,672 --> 00:17:10,759
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Soon after that, exams finally ended,</font>

230
00:17:11,301 --> 00:17:14,345
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Unfortunately for me, I
didn't score very well.</font>

231
00:17:14,429 --> 00:17:17,098
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thirtieth? How'd you place that low?</font>

232
00:17:17,182 --> 00:17:19,893
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's not as bad as you're making it seem.
- I was kinda dealing with</font>

233
00:17:19,976 --> 00:17:22,771
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">the lot the day exams started...</font>

234
00:17:22,854 --> 00:17:25,482
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The average score of the rest of my
classmates rose dramatically for some</font>

235
00:17:25,565 --> 00:17:28,234
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- reason...
- Yeah, me too!</font>

236
00:17:28,318 --> 00:17:30,945
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You saved our butts, Sadako!
- You saved our butts, Sadako!</font>

237
00:17:31,613 --> 00:17:32,947
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Zashiki-warashi.</font>

238
00:17:33,031 --> 00:17:34,449
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Zashiki-warashi.</font>

239
00:17:34,532 --> 00:17:35,658
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako-warashi?!</font>

240
00:17:36,534 --> 00:17:41,081
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's possible I'm imagining it, but after
everything that happened, it seems like</font>

241
00:17:41,164 --> 00:17:45,710
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">everyone see me differently these days...
Even if it's only a little bit. Was I able</font>

242
00:17:45,794 --> 00:17:50,381
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to do my best after all?</font>

243
00:17:52,926 --> 00:17:57,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey Sadako, let's go get some ramen.
- Oh! I-It's really okay if I tag along?</font>

244
00:17:57,764 --> 00:18:01,059
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Of course! And you could even tell us
your ghost story while we're heading over.</font>

245
00:18:01,142 --> 00:18:03,228
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah! I can't wait for you to hear it!</font>

246
00:18:03,311 --> 00:18:05,396
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do we really have to?</font>

247
00:18:06,231 --> 00:18:09,484
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- They only take cash, got any on you?
- A little, yeah.</font>

248
00:18:09,567 --> 00:18:11,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You should be fine then.</font>

249
00:18:13,154 --> 00:18:15,824
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Now that they're hanging out more,
there's no time for me to hang out with</font>

250
00:18:15,907 --> 00:18:18,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- her.
- Hey, Kazahaya, wanna hang out today?</font>

251
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:21,329
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I haven't had ramen in a while!</font>

252
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:28,378
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know what? I feel like
I've been completely reborn.</font>

253
00:18:28,962 --> 00:18:32,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It all started, the day
that I met you, Kazehaya.</font>

254
00:18:33,049 --> 00:18:34,259
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">N- No fair...</font>

255
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:37,637
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You feeling okay?</font>

256
00:18:38,513 --> 00:18:41,099
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did you know? It's common for friends
to go get ramen together pretty often</font>

257
00:18:41,182 --> 00:18:43,768
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I now have people in my life who are
very important to me. Whoa, is that true?</font>

258
00:18:44,394 --> 00:18:46,938
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't let her fool you, she
just really likes her noodles.</font>

259
00:18:47,021 --> 00:18:49,566
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">With them by my side, I was able
to do things, I couldn't do alone.</font>

260
00:18:52,610 --> 00:18:55,822
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">After seeing that smile light up her face...</font>

261
00:18:58,366 --> 00:19:02,996
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}How could I ever dream of
getting in way of their friendship.</font>

262
00:19:04,289 --> 00:19:07,083
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Why are you on the floor?
- Do you need help getting up?</font>

263
00:19:07,167 --> 00:19:09,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We can get the nurse if you need us to.</font>

264
00:19:10,879 --> 00:19:11,713
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey! Sadako!</font>

265
00:19:14,507 --> 00:19:15,550
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's that girl.</font>

266
00:19:16,134 --> 00:19:19,345
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Way to go! Looks like you achieved
your dream of making new friends.</font>

267
00:19:19,429 --> 00:19:22,640
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh... Yes!</font>

268
00:19:23,349 --> 00:19:24,475
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">New friends...</font>

269
00:19:25,685 --> 00:19:29,480
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Alright well, please be good to her!</font>

270
00:19:31,941 --> 00:19:32,859
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye!</font>

271
00:19:35,570 --> 00:19:37,488
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've been validated!</font>

272
00:19:37,572 --> 00:19:40,074
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sadako.
- Sadako.</font>

273
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:41,743
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

274
00:19:41,826 --> 00:19:44,370
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You said you didn't "like" us...
- Yeah, what was the</font>

275
00:19:44,454 --> 00:19:49,334
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- other way you put it again?
- Uh... I...</font>

276
00:19:50,335 --> 00:19:51,252
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Go on...
- Go on...</font>

277
00:19:51,836 --> 00:19:52,754
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I...</font>

278
00:19:55,298 --> 00:19:56,341
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I love you two.</font>

279
00:19:57,383 --> 00:20:01,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh yeah? So, you love us, Sawako?
- Feeling's mutual!</font>

280
00:20:06,226 --> 00:20:10,772
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">After having met Kazehaya, so
much in my life has changed.</font>

281
00:20:11,981 --> 00:20:14,859
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've learned so many new feelings.</font>

282
00:20:15,568 --> 00:20:19,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, right... How 'bout that ghost story?
- Yeah, tell it to us...</font>

283
00:20:19,530 --> 00:20:22,408
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay! H-Hoichi was a fine lute player...</font>

284
00:20:24,244 --> 00:20:26,412
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You mean "Hoichi the Earless"?!
- You mean "Hoichi the Earless"?!</font>

285
00:20:27,247 --> 00:20:31,125
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh man... Did you see
Kazehaya? He seemed pretty mad.</font>

286
00:20:31,209 --> 00:20:34,671
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... He was talking about
how he hates stupid gossip.</font>

287
00:20:34,754 --> 00:20:38,258
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think he
specifically meant us, didn't he?</font>

288
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:42,553
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Do you think she's gonna be okay?
- Why?</font>

289
00:20:44,013 --> 00:20:50,436
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just that Yuka's had a huge crush
on Kazehaya ever since middle school.</font>

290
00:20:59,946 --> 00:21:00,989
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey!</font>

291
00:21:01,072 --> 00:21:01,948
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Wait!
- Yuka!</font>

292
00:21:06,327 --> 00:21:07,745
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Such stupid girls.</font>

293
00:21:07,829 --> 00:21:11,582
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't know what they expected. When
you make a big scene like that, of course</font>

294
00:21:11,666 --> 00:21:15,461
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya is gonna hate you.</font>

295
00:22:27,075 --> 00:22:29,619
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All of the friends that I love.</font>

296
00:22:29,702 --> 00:22:31,371
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A priceless moment.</font>

297
00:22:32,372 --> 00:22:34,624
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Saturday Night"</font>
